   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "The board game <i>Mastermind</i> has 2 players. One of them is designated the codemaker who creates a code that consists of a series of 4 colors (indicated in the game with 4 colored pegs), which may contain repeats. The other player, who is the codebreaker, tries to guess the code. If there are 6 colors that the codemaker can use to make the code, how many possible codes can be made?",
